WEBVTT

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
moo-shi

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
presents:

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
http://moo-shi.no-ip.info/ #moo-shi@irc.rizon.net

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:12.920
<i>It's no use!</i>

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:16.970
<i>There is no escape from me!</i>

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:39.240
Well, we'll be off now...

00:02:39.710 --> 00:02:42.470
<i>Thanks for your help today.</i>

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:45.480
<i>You do good work,
Ghost of the Desert, Sunabouzu.</i>

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:48.040
Nah, I still got a long ways to go...

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:52.500
<i>But to think you would
take on a pupil of your own...</i>

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:55.220
<i>Thanks for your help too, Taiko-chan.</i>

00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:58.720
<i>No, I didn't really do much at all...</i>

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:01.780
'Cause all you did was baby-sit Mitsuru...

00:03:06.430 --> 00:03:11.220
Geez. I see you still hide behind
your old man like always...

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:16.900
Yay! Weakling! Weakling!
Weakling!

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:20.640
Yay! Weakling! Weakling!

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:20.640
<i>Hey, now, don't tease Mitsuru too much.</i>

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:22.610
<i>We wouldn't want it to happen out here.</i>

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:27.350
Good point! Sorry!

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:30.630
<i>Let's have dinner again sometime...</i>

00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:33.200
Yeah! Take care, Master!

00:03:38.430 --> 00:03:42.110
<i>What a surprise! You had a master, too!</i>

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:47.560
Of course I did. All newbie’s start out
training as someone's student.

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:51.970
<i>But it's hard to believe that my
master's master is that kind of person...</i>

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:54.280
<i>He doesn't seem very strong...</i>

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:56.830
Hmm, I guess...

00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:59.460
<i>But he's actually super awesome, right?</i>

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:02.420
No, he's just like he looks.

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:04.800
<i>Oh... I see.</i>

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:07.570
<i>Kan-chan!</i>

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:12.430
These insanely giant breasts!
These unforgettable boobs!

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:14.590
It's Asagiri Junko!

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:18.010
<i>Recognize my face, not my chest!</i>

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:21.140
<i>You're the one who showed it off...</i>

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:25.150
<i>I finally found you!</i>

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:29.750
<i>I went into town to find you,
but they said you were out on a job</i>

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:34.150
<i>so I chased after you, but I guess
I passed you on the way out!</i>

00:04:34.150 --> 00:04:36.110
Let me go!

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:37.680
I don't think so!

00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:40.890
You have some nerve to show
your face in front of me!

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:44.300
You sure know how to screw a guy over!

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:45.670
<i>Oh? Whatever do you mean?</i>

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:47.210
Don't give me that!

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:51.030
<i>Was there some kind of debt
between you and me?</i>

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:53.000
Why, you little!

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:57.270
<i>Master! If you're referring to the
other day, you did sign the contract.</i>

00:04:57.270 --> 00:05:00.600
<i>Right after falling
into her womanly trap...</i>

00:05:02.340 --> 00:05:05.150
<i>You're done with today's job, right?</i>

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:06.930
<i>I already spoke with the Mugenya!</i>

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:09.550
<i>Here, your new job!</i>

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:11.270
What?!

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:14.460
<i>It's a Mugenya form!</i>

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:17.930
What the hell? "Help Asagiri Junko"?!

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:21.280
For two million yen?!

00:05:22.870 --> 00:05:25.310
<i>You can't object
to two million yen, right?</i>

00:05:25.310 --> 00:05:27.370
What the hell did you do?

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:28.080
<i>What do you mean?!</i>

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:32.040
It's pretty fishy,
getting two million just for helping you!

00:05:32.280 --> 00:05:34.160
<i>This sounds really dangerous...</i>

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:34.930
Forget it!

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:41.240
Even if it isn't dangerous,
I refuse to do anything for you!

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:55.280
<i>If you don't help me,
I'll be forced into a marriage!</i>

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:56.340
What?!

00:05:58.360 --> 00:06:00.850
<i>Did something just flash?</i>

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:07.350
<i>A sniper!</i>

00:06:09.270 --> 00:06:10.070
<i>Master!</i>

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:14.660
<i>He's alive! It's just a concussion!</i>

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:16.370
<i>He's here!</i>

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:18.540
<i>We gotta run! Gimme a hand!</i>

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:21.290
<i>You're going to help me?!</i>

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:23.570
<i>This doesn't mean we're
doing it as a job, though!</i>

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:26.260
<i>I thought you hated me?!</i>

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:29.050
<i>I despise you! But!</i>

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:33.100
<i>I can't carry him all by myself!</i>

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:41.840
<i>Master would probably kill me
if I did anything to you,</i>

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:47.140
<i>and besides, we need info from you
to do something about that sniper!</i>

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:49.820
<i>What a sassy runt!</i>

00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:52.170
<i>Ow!</i>

00:06:58.640 --> 00:07:01.780
<i>She just doesn't know
when to give up!</i>

00:07:15.230 --> 00:07:16.250
That sound!

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:21.240
<i>Kan-chan!</i>

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:24.260
Junko!

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:36.430
<i>If you don't help me,
I'll be forced into a marriage!</i>

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:41.080
Junko!

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:48.960
Junko!

00:07:56.020 --> 00:07:58.640
<i>Oh, you're awake! Are you OK?!</i>

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:02.240
<i>- S-stop, that tickles!</i>

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:02.240
- Junko! Boobie Lady!

00:08:08.950 --> 00:08:09.860
<i>You up?</i>

00:08:09.860 --> 00:08:12.450
Yeah, I'm up...

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:17.690
Taiko. Situation.

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:20.000
<i>It's been about an hour
since the initial attack.</i>

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:23.160
<i>We passed through a rock forest
and into an Exocet cave.</i>

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:26.510
<i>Looks like we were sniped
from pretty far off...</i>

00:08:26.510 --> 00:08:30.640
<i>The sound came afterward. He's good.</i>

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:33.870
<i>The only damage was
your helmet and that lump.</i>

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:39.950
<i>Things would've been bad had the
bullet been three centimeters lower!</i>

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:42.980
<i>Incidentally,
your recon equipment is trashed.</i>

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:45.220
Damn it!

00:08:45.510 --> 00:08:47.360
<i>So, what do we do?</i>

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:49.030
<i>Please! Help me!</i>

00:08:49.030 --> 00:08:51.930
<i>I say we chuck this broad out!</i>

00:08:51.930 --> 00:08:54.360
<i>I don't remember asking your opinion!</i>

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:57.180
<i>We're out of ammo and food, you know!</i>

00:08:57.730 --> 00:09:01.000
Taiko. Sorry, but we're taking the job.

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:02.290
<i>Eh?</i>

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:03.960
<i>- Eh!?!
- Really?!</i>

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:05.690
<i>I can't accept that!</i>

00:09:06.860 --> 00:09:13.240
I know. I'm incredibly sick
of Junko always using me, too.

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:15.730
But...

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:23.890
...I hate the idea of Junko
belonging to another man even more!

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:29.970
<i>Oh, Kan-chan!</i>

00:09:29.970 --> 00:09:31.310
However!

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:34.440
<i>W-what?</i>

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:36.640
Only if you'll be my woman...

00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:38.110
<i>No!</i>

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:43.710
<i>Don't be stingy. You're supposed
to be the great Sunabouzu.</i>

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:48.520
<i>If you really do want me,
then win me over with true skill!</i>

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:49.750
Why, you!

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:52.670
<i>And then I'll do so much
for you you'll hate it!</i>

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:56.970
<i>I'll do absolutely
anything that-you-say!</i>

00:09:56.970 --> 00:09:58.860
A-anything?!

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:00.530
<i>All for free, of course!</i>

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:03.480
Free, instead of 10,000 yen per feel?!

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:08.200
<i>You'll never be able to win me over
if I wind up someone else's, right?</i>

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:10.390
<i>Now sign this!</i>

00:10:10.390 --> 00:10:11.810
Sure thing!

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:17.150
<i>I figured it'd turn out like this...</i>

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:35.730
<i>It's one person 300 meters north!</i>

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:40.180
300 meters?! He's already
that close?! Kosuna, did you...

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:41.340
<i>I did it!</i>

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:45.980
<i>I'll have you know it was tough
to do while dragging your body!</i>

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:49.150
<i>- He has an advanced desert suit!
- Advanced?!</i>

00:10:49.700 --> 00:10:51.380
<i>It has incredible scouting abilities!</i>

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:53.940
<i>Don't assume ordinary stuff
will work on it!</i>

00:10:56.450 --> 00:10:58.570
It's that good?!

00:10:58.570 --> 00:11:02.850
<i>It wiped out 13 fully-equipped
mercenaries in the blink of an eye!</i>

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:07.430
Why couldn't you have mentioned
that before I signed?

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:09.380
<i>Not like this is new, though...</i>

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:17.720
<i>He's shooting at us!</i>

00:11:17.720 --> 00:11:21.430
Damn! He can hit stuff that far
away in the desert at night?!

00:11:21.430 --> 00:11:24.480
<i>I told you! It's an advanced suit!</i>

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:29.560
<i>We're just sitting ducks at this rate!</i>

00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:31.790
<i>Do you have any kind of plan?!</i>

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:34.890
No ammo! Bad spot! For now, we just run!

00:11:34.890 --> 00:11:36.160
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:37.860
Just get in a line!

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:39.750
<i>R-right!</i>

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:42.100
Hold it! Junko stays in back!

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:43.520
<i>How come?!</i>

00:11:48.070 --> 00:11:51.000
<i>Damn! I can't shoot
with Junko in the way!</i>

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:54.730
<i>Lucky bastards!</i>

00:11:58.850 --> 00:12:03.730
<i>Damn you, Asagiri Junko!
Who are you trying to use this time?!</i>

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:08.410
<i>He fell for it. He's surprisingly dumb.</i>

00:12:12.930 --> 00:12:14.970
<i>No good! He's still alive!</i>

00:12:14.970 --> 00:12:19.300
Dammit! I would've planted a
real bomb had I known this'd happen!

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:22.790
<i>What's wrong with you?!
Of course a gas bomb wouldn't work!</i>

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:25.450
A real bomb would've blown the helmet up!

00:12:26.710 --> 00:12:29.330
<i>You were planning to go back for it?</i>

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:32.380
Shut up! Just run!

00:12:36.010 --> 00:12:37.670
<i>Asagiri...</i>

00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:43.490
<i>...Junko!</i>

00:12:58.270 --> 00:12:59.420
<i>Think we lost him?</i>

00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:02.440
Yeah, probably.

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:07.620
It'd be impossible to long-range snipe
here in this rock forest...

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:10.250
<i>Now we can pull
ourselves together again...</i>

00:13:10.250 --> 00:13:11.520
<i>I wouldn't be so sure.</i>

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:12.340
Huh?

00:13:13.590 --> 00:13:15.390
<i>One week.</i>

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:19.390
<i>For one week I did everything
possible to get away from him!</i>

00:13:19.390 --> 00:13:22.890
But he always managed to corner you?

00:13:24.840 --> 00:13:27.340
Think you can tell us everything?

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:29.740
<i>You've heard of Uzumaki Chemicals, right?</i>

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:32.780
The North Oasis desert suit company?

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:34.720
<i>That suit was developed there.</i>

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:38.880
<i>After analyzing unearthed
Dark Age technology without permission.</i>

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:40.540
Contraband, huh?!

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:43.220
No wonder it's such a pain in the ass...

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:48.900
<i>The guy after me helped develop
that suit; his name's Tanigawa.</i>

00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:52.530
<i>So, why is he after you?</i>

00:13:52.530 --> 00:13:58.380
<i>I originally got close to him to
get at Uzumaki Chemicals' secrets...</i>

00:13:58.380 --> 00:14:04.430
<i>Club
Basue</i>

00:14:01.170 --> 00:14:03.270
<i>Junko! Run off with me!</i>

00:14:03.270 --> 00:14:04.430
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:14:04.430 --> 00:14:04.910
<i>Ah?!</i>

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:09.110
<i>If we sell this Dark Age drive to a
rival company, we'll be filthy rich!</i>

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:11.510
<i>W-what are you saying?!</i>

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:16.850
<i>You know how I feel! Let's live enjoyable,
rich lives together!</i>

00:14:16.850 --> 00:14:18.290
<i>Are you crazy?</i>

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:19.160
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:25.390
<i>It's contraband. It's not something
you can handle privately, you know?</i>

00:14:25.390 --> 00:14:27.500
<i>B-but I!</i>

00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:29.090
<i>Let me be frank!</i>

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:32.300
<i>The reason I got close to you</i>

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:35.170
<i>was because you worked for
a big technology company!</i>

00:14:35.170 --> 00:14:38.070
<i>What worth does a butt-ugly man
who quit his company have?!</i>

00:14:38.070 --> 00:14:40.280
<i>D-damn you!</i>

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:48.380
<i>Junko!</i>

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:55.680
<i>Don't toy with me! I swear
I will make you my woman!</i>

00:14:57.560 --> 00:14:59.800
<i>You didn't need to be that harsh...</i>

00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:01.500
That'd make anyone mad...

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:03.690
<i>But he just pissed me off!</i>

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:12.230
<i>Uzumaki Chemicals, Ltd.
Desert Suit, Fisheye Special!</i>

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:19.580
<i>Equipment size and power
consumption successfully reduced!</i>

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:22.020
<i>Also comes fully equipped
with embedded AC,</i>

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:25.290
<i>a large-screen display,
and enhanced recon equipment!</i>

00:15:25.780 --> 00:15:30.190
<i>Its comfortable fit is impossible
to imagine from its sluggish exterior!</i>

00:15:30.190 --> 00:15:33.560
<i>It can also remain in continued
operation twice the normal amount!</i>

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:35.360
<i>Twice</i>

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:37.360
<i>Twice! Twice!</i>

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:39.740
<i>...in a nutshell.</i>

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:40.940
<i>Wow!</i>

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:45.410
<i>Twice the operation
means twice the income!</i>

00:15:45.410 --> 00:15:46.780
<i>Think you can handle him?</i>

00:15:46.780 --> 00:15:49.980
If I beat someone that awesome,
will you fall for me?!

00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:54.770
<i>I dunno... I can't say anything
for sure until you do beat him up...</i>

00:15:54.770 --> 00:15:56.450
<i>This is seriously bad!</i>

00:15:56.450 --> 00:16:00.260
<i>I'm the only one with recon equipment,
we have almost no ammo left,</i>

00:16:00.260 --> 00:16:02.420
<i>and the temperature's
almost in the negatives,</i>

00:16:02.420 --> 00:16:06.620
<i>but I can't use my heater
now that I'm on my last battery!</i>

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:09.600
I've already been
shivering for a while now!

00:16:09.600 --> 00:16:14.720
<i>My night suit is perfect at
retaining warmth, so I'm just fine!</i>

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:19.970
The real problem is he'll still
catch us no matter how much we run...

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:41.590
<i>Junko...</i>

00:16:45.490 --> 00:16:46.840
<i>Drink up!</i>

00:16:46.840 --> 00:16:49.000
<i>Thanks!</i>

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:52.540
<i>You're so smart, Tanigawa-san!
You're wonderful!</i>

00:16:52.540 --> 00:16:55.190
<i>No, you're too kind!</i>

00:16:55.190 --> 00:16:56.710
<i>Client List</i>

00:16:55.190 --> 00:16:56.710
<i>South Oasis (20-40)</i>

00:16:55.190 --> 00:16:56.710
<i>INTERNAL USE ONLY</i>

00:16:57.220 --> 00:17:02.680
<i>I'm sorry... If your company finds out,
you'll be in so much trouble!</i>

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:06.500
<i>It's all right! This is
no big deal at all!</i>

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:14.120
<i>What worth does a butt-ugly man
who quit his company have?</i>

00:17:15.860 --> 00:17:16.860
<i>There!</i>

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:25.810
<i>- He's here!</i>

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:25.810
- What the?!

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:27.020
Say what?!

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:28.580
<i>Where's he shooting from?!</i>

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:31.130
<i>He's sniping between the rock pillars!</i>

00:17:31.130 --> 00:17:33.550
That's insane! No one
can shoot that good!

00:17:37.720 --> 00:17:39.560
<i>Damn, he's persistent!</i>

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:42.220
<i>Cover and darkness don't matter to him!</i>

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:45.370
<i>He systematically corners
his prey before finishing it off!</i>

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:46.660
Kosuna! Blinders!

00:17:46.660 --> 00:17:47.570
<i>Right!</i>

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:56.500
This should buy us a little time.

00:17:56.500 --> 00:18:00.150
<i>It's no use! I told you
ordinary tactics won't work!</i>

00:18:00.150 --> 00:18:01.920
Damn it!

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:07.180
<i>Ugh! Watch your step,
you don't have your night scope!</i>

00:18:08.430 --> 00:18:10.420
Looks like this is the end!

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:11.520
<i>Master?!</i>

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:12.910
<i>What're you saying?!</i>

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:15.970
Ain't no way we can beat that monster!

00:18:15.970 --> 00:18:20.930
<i>You're pathetic!
What happened to winning me over?!</i>

00:18:20.930 --> 00:18:24.430
<i>You're supposed to be the great Sunabouzu!
Quit pissin' your pants!</i>

00:18:24.430 --> 00:18:26.800
What'd you say, you damn...

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:29.570
P-pissing?

00:18:29.570 --> 00:18:35.260
<i>You're a man! That means
you're supposed to save weak...</i>

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:36.890
<i>M- Master?</i>

00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:39.850
<i>- Kan-chan... Are you alright?</i>

00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:39.850
- Pissing! Pissing! Pissing!

00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:42.540
That's it! Why didn't I think of it?!

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:54.640
<i>I finally caught you.</i>

00:18:57.870 --> 00:19:00.200
<i>What happened to your help?</i>

00:19:00.200 --> 00:19:05.640
<i>They're hiding. Your head's in both
of their crosshairs as we speak.</i>

00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:08.210
<i>There's nobody within a 200 meter radius.</i>

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:14.220
<i>No one can snipe from over 200 meters
in a rock forest during the day, much less at night.</i>

00:19:14.220 --> 00:19:16.300
<i>There's no way to know unless you try.</i>

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:23.690
<i>Another blinder?! How pointless...</i>

00:19:23.690 --> 00:19:25.950
<i>I dunno. I wouldn't say so.</i>

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:27.290
<i>What?!</i>

00:19:44.080 --> 00:19:45.050
<i>Alright!</i>

00:19:45.640 --> 00:19:48.720
<i>Impossible! There was
nothing on my radar!</i>

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:50.410
<i>Where was he hiding?</i>

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:54.290
Ditch the suit. Any funny moves
and I'll kill you.

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:54.990
<i>Mud?!</i>

00:19:54.990 --> 00:19:59.530
<i>Now I see! You covered yourself
in cool mud to conceal your heat!</i>

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:06.110
And that blinder warmed up the area
to make it even harder to see me...

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:10.770
Even the best equipment
works the same, right?

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:16.040
<i>B-but where'd the mud come from?!
How'd you get mud in a desert?!</i>

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:19.250
<i>Hey!</i>

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:22.230
<i>You better not look! Or listen!</i>

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:25.520
So this is Junko's pee-pee!

00:20:25.520 --> 00:20:26.970
<i>- Pervert!</i>

00:20:26.970 --> 00:20:29.360
<i>I-I'm so jealous!</i>

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:30.160
<i>Hey, now!</i>

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:33.770
<i>Ugh! To think high-tech
would lose to pee!</i>

00:20:37.700 --> 00:20:39.300
<i>It really is incredible...</i>

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:40.600
Eh?

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:44.780
<i>There's still so much out there
you'll never know unless you try...</i>

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:49.610
This's what you get when you put
too much faith in machines, boyo!

00:20:49.610 --> 00:20:51.410
<i>Now do you get it?!</i>

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:54.850
<i>It looks like you
learned a lot this time,</i>

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:58.620
<i>but it just goes to show
how much of a spoiled novice you are!</i>

00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:04.230
C'mon, quit blubberin' and strip!

00:21:04.230 --> 00:21:07.060
<i>C-could you tell me one last thing?!</i>

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.240
What?!

00:21:08.650 --> 00:21:13.100
<i>How did you know I would
come out here instead of sniping?</i>

00:21:13.100 --> 00:21:16.540
'Cause if I were you, I wouldn't
want some unknown man and Junko

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:19.580
to be together even for a minute...

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:24.310
<i>So you saw through everything...</i>

00:21:30.450 --> 00:21:34.420
OK, that's enough! Now hand
the damn thing over!

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:38.100
C-crap!

00:21:47.670 --> 00:21:49.900
G-get back here!

00:21:51.510 --> 00:21:57.450
Damn! I underestimated him!

00:21:57.450 --> 00:22:01.620
Guess I'm not one to talk about Junko...

00:22:01.620 --> 00:22:03.670
How uncool...

00:22:03.670 --> 00:22:05.240
<i>Master!</i>

00:23:54.480 --> 00:23:57.040
<i>It's Boob Lady of the Desert,
Asagiri Junko!</i>

00:23:57.040 --> 00:23:59.550
<i>Oh no! I've been kidnapped?
Someone save me.</i>

00:23:59.550 --> 00:24:01.750
<i>- Shut up! Listen! You're...
- Hold on! That boob girl.</i>

00:24:01.750 --> 00:24:03.000
<i>- belongs to me!
- Belongs to me!</i>

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:05.230
<i>No! Please don't fight over me, you two!</i>

00:24:05.230 --> 00:24:06.140
<i>...Men.</i>

00:24:06.140 --> 00:24:07.570
<i>Next episode is
"Frustration and Despair"!</i>

00:24:07.590 --> 00:24:09.500
<i>Miss it and you'll be called "Chi-chan"!</i>
